    Toroidal & $2.187\ [2.121,2.251]$ & $1.890\ [1.848,1.935]$ & $1.423\ [1.398,1.449]$ \\
    Interior reference & $2.199\ [2.133,2.267]$ & $1.894\ [1.851,1.941]$ & $1.429\ [1.402,1.455]$ \\
    \midrule
    Bernoulli null (matched $\rho=0.0959$) & \multicolumn{3}{c}{$1.466\pm0.021$} \\
